CloudBurrow patch 80 to github.com/goccy/googlesqlite v0.3.1
(cloudburrow/cloudburrow#1623).

DecodeStringArray reads an ARRAY<STRING> column QueryRawContext (patch
0019) returned, as DecodeString reads a STRING one, so that
bigquery-emulator patch 0080 can read a project's dataset IDs as SQLite
SQL: every request finds its project, and its GoogleSQL read cost the
project's size.

